# Write-ups (Disciplinary)

Employee disciplinary records with a signature/acknowledgement lifecycle, prior-
discipline history, attachments, and optional linkage to a coaching session.
Follows [.cursor/rules/backend-api-conventions.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/backend-api-conventions.mdc).

## Backend map (`backend/src/`)

There is NO monolithic `writeup.controller.ts` / `writeup.service.ts` — both are
split by concern. Add new logic to the matching slice; do not recombine.

- `services/writeups/` — `writeup.list.service.ts` (list/detail/prior-discipline),
  `writeup.lifecycle.service.ts` (create/update + notes),
  `writeup.transition.service.ts` (status transitions, sign, follow-up),
  `writeup.search.service.ts` (QA-record + coaching search),
  `writeup.attachment.service.ts`, `writeup.linkedCoaching.service.ts`.
  Shared: `writeup.types.ts`, `writeup.permissions.ts` (transition matrix +
  visibility/CSR guards), `writeup.helpers.ts`, `index.ts` (barrel).
- `controllers/writeups/` — thin controllers mirroring the services
  (`list`, `lifecycle`, `search`, `attachment`, `linkedCoaching`). `respond.ts`
  maps a thrown `WriteUpServiceError` to the response — route errors through it.
- `routes/writeup.routes.ts` — `/api/writeups`; gated by `authorizePage('pw_list', …)`.
- `validation/writeup.validation.ts` — `CreateWriteUpSchema` / `UpdateWriteUpSchema`;
  doc types `VERBAL_WARNING` / `WRITTEN_WARNING` / `FINAL_WARNING`.

## Lifecycle (enforced by `writeup.permissions.ts`)

`DRAFT → SCHEDULED → AWAITING_SIGNATURE → SIGNED | SIGNATURE_REFUSED → CLOSED`,
with a `FOLLOW_UP_PENDING → FOLLOW_UP_COMPLETED → CLOSED` branch. Never transition
statuses ad hoc — go through `writeup.transition.service.ts` and the matrix.

## Permissions

`useWriteUpRole` (frontend): `canManage` (admin/QA/manager), `canEdit`
(admin/manager), `isAgent`. Backend gates on `pw_list` page access; CSRs see only
their own non-`DRAFT` records; the sign endpoint self-checks the acting user.

## Frontend map (`frontend/src/pages/writeups/`)

Pages `WriteUpsPage` / `MyWriteUpsPage` (+ detail) compose `writeup-form/*` and
`writeup-detail/*` section components; `writeup-pdf/*` renders the PDF. API +
status enums live in `services/writeupService.ts`. Obey [.cursor/rules/ui-design.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/ui-design.mdc).
